# CEPU

Cepu, An App For Report Bully In School.


## Authors

- [@Lahnan](https://www.github.com/lahnan)
- [@Josh](https://www.github.com/JoshNotChicken)


## Features

- Change Image Map
- Add Location
- Real Time Database Update
- Notification Sound
- Get User Data(For Security)


## Demo
Coming Soon


## Deployment

RECOMENDED VERSION



```bash
1. Setup Server
PHP: 8.1
APACHE: 2.4
MYSQL: 8.0

2 Copy This Repo Using Git
"git clone https://github.com/TerpENVISION/cepu.git"

3 Add .env Using 'contoh-env'
4 Make Database And Import Database.sql
```

